invariant: INV-35
file: Makefile
catches: test/lib-check-webpki-tcp-nonblocking.sh
reason: TRANSPORT_NAMED stops naming ch_anchors_from_pem, so PUBLIC lists
  the name pem_files.h declares while the object defines the name the
  header maps it to, ch_anchors_from_pem_tcp_nonblocking, and lib-check's
  export list differs from PUBLIC. An image of two transports needs each
  object's call under its own name (docs/decisions.md 61 and 131).

